s; the lyric text itself only conveys mood. |\n| max_duration | Target song length in seconds (default 120 = 2 minutes; the model supports up to ~300 s / 5 minutes). Longer songs take more time and VRAM. |\n| seed | Random seed for the generation. Keep it fixed to reproduce the same song; change it to get a different take. |\n| Model files | diffusion model / text encoder / VAE.|\n| Tiled decode | Decode the audio VAE in overlapping tiles to drastically cut VRAM usage — helpful for long songs on low-VRAM GPUs. Slightly slower, with a small risk of seams at tile boundaries; turn it off on high-VRAM GPUs for the best quality. |\n\n### Prompt Writing Guide\n\nYou can find an official [Music Caption Rewriter Skill here](https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-Music3)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax Music 3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [520, 660], "pos": [-3572.812744140625, 481.5264587402344], "id": 39, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["新会员注册福利：\n打开链接：https://www.runninghub.cn/?inviteCode=pyespett 注册领500RH币可以免费生成好多图片视频哦！\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "Note", "title": "新会员注册福利", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [658.0230712890625, 88], "pos": [2249.662841796875, 1024.6756591796875], "id": 56, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [70], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [60.000000000000014], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Float", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [270, 58], "pos": [3046.69677734375, 1302.835693359375], "id": 54, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Float"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [68], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Global Metadata:\nGenre: Chinese folk ballad, slowcore, lo-fi.\nSubgenre: Confessional singer-songwriter, melancholic folk.\nBPM: 60, extremely slow.\nKey: C minor.\nScale: Natural minor, with unresolved, suspended chords.\nEmotional Progression: Starts with deep fatigue, moves into complete hopelessness, and ends with a state of numb resignation. No relief, no resolution.\nListening Scenario: A lone person sitting on the floor of a cheap, dimly lit rented room late at night, having completely given up.\nProduction Profile: Lo-fi, extremely rough texture, like a recording from a broken phone in a damp basement. No warmth, no high-end frequencies. Everything sounds dark, muffled, and sinking.\n\nVocal Details:\nConfiguration: Solo male vocal.\nTimbre & Register: Dry, aged, hoarse, and utterly parched, as if all moisture has been drained from the throat. Sits in a low, mumbling register.\nPerformance Style: Half-sung, half-spoken, with a lethargic, defeated delivery. Pronunciation is slurred and breath is short. Sung with a near-exhausted low hum. No strong notes or outbursts. Each word sounds squeezed out from the throat. Occasional pauses and silences feel like the singer simply can't be bothered to finish.\nHarmony & Effects: None. Completely dry, no reverb or warmth.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [346.5619812011719, 334.5163269042969], "pos": [2282.355224609375, 1237.9896240234375], "id": 52, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "color": "#432", "widget